sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Todos as Todos Panel (SPC x)
    participant Picker as AgentAssignPicker
    participant Daemon as AutoDoc Daemon (core/todo)
    participant Agents as TerminalTabs / Agent PTY

    User->>Todos: Press 'A' on selected task
    Todos->>Picker: Open Picker with assignable AgentEntries
    User->>Picker: Select agent (e.g. Claude Code, codename: claude)
    Picker->>Todos: Prompt for optional Instructions line
    User->>Todos: Enter instruction (default: "Task assigned to you.")
    Todos->>Daemon: todos.assign(at, id, rev, "autodoc:claude", instruction)
    Note over Daemon: D1 Rule: Atomically transition open to in-progress, move file to in-progress/, and record journal row
    Daemon-->>Todos: Updated task (status: "in-progress", new path & rev)
    Todos->>Todos: Follow task to In Progress tab (if workspace ticket current)
    Todos->>Agents: Core.HandTask(AgentRef{Codename: "claude"}, TaskRef, instruction)
    alt Agent PTY not yet running
        Agents->>User: Ask confirmation to start agent profile
        User-->>Agents: Confirm start (&Yes)
        Agents->>Agents: Write workspace guide & spawn PTY tab
    end
    Agents->>Agents: Focus agent tab & send bracketed paste (Task, File, ID, Instruction)
    Agents->>Agents: Wait agentSubmitDelay (60ms) then send Enter (\r)
    Agents-->>Todos: Delivery complete callback on UI loop
    Todos-->>User: Toast: "todos: assigned to Claude Code, and handed to its terminal"
